    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (Cost of Living Tax Cuts) Act 2024</p>
      <p>No. 3, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Income Tax Rates Act 1986</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
